==Trivia==
This card's number in the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion is 026, which is also {{p|Raichu}}'s [[National Pokédex]] [[List of Pokémon by National Pokédex number|number]].

===Origin===
*'''Gigashock''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Raichu|14}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

